WEBVTT

1.1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.270
Step 1. Open the questionnaire.

1.2
00:00:02.270 --> 00:00:07.157
In Settings, under Forms, select Questionnaires, and select it in the list.

1.3
00:00:07.157 --> 00:00:13.130
When you save changed questions, Care keeps the earlier questions as a past version.

2.1
00:00:13.130 --> 00:00:17.167
Step 2. Open the question editor. Select Edit Questions.

2.2
00:00:17.167 --> 00:00:21.157
You can also start from Add Question in the Questions list,

2.3
00:00:21.157 --> 00:00:24.158
or from the row menu of one question.

3.1
00:00:24.158 --> 00:00:27.033
Step 3. Add a question or a section.

3.2
00:00:27.033 --> 00:00:32.210
Select Add new question, and Care adds a String question with no title.

3.3
00:00:32.210 --> 00:00:36.210
To add a group of questions, select Add Section.

4.1
00:00:36.210 --> 00:00:41.582
Step 4. Fill in the Question tab. Every question needs a Question Title.

4.2
00:00:41.582 --> 00:00:47.843
Then choose the Answer type, and set Required, Repeatable or Read only as needed.

5.1
00:00:47.843 --> 00:00:49.723
Step 5. Set the answers.

5.2
00:00:49.723 --> 00:00:54.068
For a Choice question, add Custom Options or select a Value Set.

5.3
00:00:54.068 --> 00:01:00.135
For a Quantity question, select the valueset of units that people can answer with.

6.1
00:01:00.135 --> 00:01:06.424
Step 6. Choose when the question appears. In the Logic tab, select Add a condition.

6.2
00:01:06.424 --> 00:01:10.134
With no conditions, Care always shows the question.

6.3
00:01:10.134 --> 00:01:13.983
Read the rule under In plain words.

7.1
00:01:13.983 --> 00:01:17.368
Step 7. Link the question to a standard code.

7.2
00:01:17.368 --> 00:01:22.174
Use the Coding tab when answers must be comparable across facilities.

7.3
00:01:22.174 --> 00:01:26.575
To record more fields with the answer, use Also capture.

8.1
00:01:26.575 --> 00:01:29.822
Step 8. Move, copy or delete a question.

8.2
00:01:29.822 --> 00:01:35.517
Select the question in the form, then use its buttons to move it up or down,

8.3
00:01:35.517 --> 00:01:38.040
duplicate it, or delete it.

9.1
00:01:38.040 --> 00:01:40.056
Step 9. Save the changes.

9.2
00:01:40.056 --> 00:01:44.506
Fix any issues that the editor lists, then select Save Changes.

9.3
00:01:44.506 --> 00:01:49.945
Care saves changed questions as a new version and shows Questionnaire updated

9.4
00:01:49.945 --> 00:01:51.363
successfully.
